# -------------------------------------------------------------
# RAJASTHAN POLICE MARATHON 2026 - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Default Local Mode:
# If TURSO_DATABASE_URL is left empty, the portal automatically uses
# a persistent local SQLite database at: data/rajasthan_police_marathon.db
#
# Production Zero-Cost Mode (Turso Cloud Edge DB - 9 GB Free Tier):
# 1. Sign up free at: https://turso.tech (No credit card needed)
# 2. Run: turso db create rajpol-marathon --location bom (Mumbai, India)
# 3. Add these to Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables:
#
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://rajpol-marathon-yourusername.turso.io
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_turso_auth_token_here
#
# Security Secret Salt:
# APP_SECRET=rajpol_marathon_2026_super_secure_salt_jaipur
# -------------------------------------------------------------
